    <mdiv type="solesmes">
      <score>
        <section>
          <pb xml:id="m-7cd6625e-2330-47ea-bfbe-4ef8d2b4f831" n="0337" facs="#m-b957b476-6c09-4f64-89f1-cfd5e82bedfc" /><div xml:id="m-81052cbd-b5a4-49a1-adf1-9e31c7e020a6">
            <lg xml:id="m-9e6962e3-b782-445b-8f1d-bc1102c687ed">
              <l xml:id="m-3fd757b9-5921-43b3-b54c-fabff8210ba2" facs="#m-4e38d559-395f-4969-8b12-add748e99815" label="ambiguous">225</l><l xml:id="m-f2d39178-df70-4d5c-ac08-01aaf2e7e49b" facs="#m-18578e02-1307-4966-82b1-232b730e7296" label="text-like">Sunday at Prime.</l><l xml:id="m-c005a985-e3dc-480d-8a58-27c51dd3f063" facs="#m-9dd8052d-618f-42ad-8492-4b420abb05e0" label="text-like">In Paschal Time.</l><l xml:id="m-1ec66df8-642c-4216-8003-132298af26b4" facs="#m-cb9db066-fa7f-457c-8b2f-f76c70ca20a6" label="ambiguous">3.b</l><l xml:id="m-9421c822-0e80-432a-96c2-d0f1332528db" facs="#m-eddadc6d-6612-4ea0-aaef-553f2119c887" label="lyrics-like">Lle-lú-ia. Eu o u a e.</l><l xml:id="m-fe7c007d-f4a9-4d12-a482-1be37027562f" facs="#m-b8fde945-a90b-41b1-9272-5cb351caf497" label="text-like">During Advent, Septuagesima, and Lent, the Antiphon is taken from the</l><l xml:id="m-5f633327-e7a4-4185-b0e8-e38201eb60bc" facs="#m-4b49b174-92aa-408c-96b9-800d3e4f7d6c" label="text-like">Proper of the Time; and on Feast days, from the Proper of the Feast.</l><l xml:id="m-1f659f71-708d-418a-8efd-75811dcc7216" facs="#m-f822cdc0-dbd7-4675-a979-71fcefa9bbaa" label="ambiguous">I.</l><l xml:id="m-310adc24-cfec-49b2-8831-e1ca44b78df8" facs="#m-d9609161-16c2-4995-9ba7-ad412d8847d5" label="lyrics-like">Non móriar, sed vivam:*</l><l xml:id="m-f8853fac-ff95-4c69-8ce6-725acd96d4a3" facs="#m-74b77d83-e83b-4e0b-9639-ee283ba2eb4b" label="ambiguous">Psalm 117.</l><l xml:id="m-76f2b349-2c48-49d6-87b3-2c4c4f9aa555" facs="#m-b3af3053-391f-4831-8e87-14e6d155ce01" label="lyrics-like">(Vonfitémini Dómino quóniam narrábo ópera Domini.</l><l xml:id="m-5b63faf3-2c72-4875-bfb5-2c159a82f20a" facs="#m-443c5f12-8978-4dcc-b2ad-dfb697004557" label="lyrics-like">Castigans castigávit me Dómi¬</l><l xml:id="m-5ba47f0c-048a-4424-9a5d-b022acc155b7" facs="#m-ca5aae08-6c6a-4573-b139-97f72a65cbd2" label="lyrics-like">L bónus:* quóniam in saéculum</l><l xml:id="m-b76cbcf7-1b14-44e5-8bd1-f02d7b0451b2" facs="#m-c3d23b1d-5c38-4b3e-b7ea-496604d3403f" label="lyrics-like">nus :* ẽt mórti non trádidit me.</l><l xml:id="m-bb2701fa-c0cb-4f3f-924b-b5bf6a2e6828" facs="#m-43bddd5b-a554-4ba3-b38f-9281c23dcb99" label="lyrics-like">misericordia éjus.</l><l xml:id="m-71d93595-cdf1-41b2-8c19-b879b2784bfc" facs="#m-65d41201-9ff8-45c7-8b5e-f5e1b4b0d488" label="lyrics-like">Aperite mihi pórtas justitiae, !</l><l xml:id="m-6652f8dc-379c-4992-bb03-4fee665f36bf" facs="#m-6c77accd-3193-4dc6-b94a-33e461288126" label="lyrics-like">Dicat nunc Israel quóniam bó¬</l><l xml:id="m-25941062-05c8-42b7-8ba6-1f4010806ed0" facs="#m-c06b6d05-d4de-4d5d-953e-e125c77a2610" label="lyrics-like">ingréssus in éas confitébor bomi¬</l><l xml:id="m-13a274c5-7a21-4c34-a028-c362d69c61f7" facs="#m-1e23912b-c917-46b0-87a9-b8b431f7a160" label="lyrics-like">nus : * quóniam in saéculum mise¬</l><l xml:id="m-f7fb1532-7c88-4627-8e1d-854bc2e8c218" facs="#m-6aa819fe-a951-4983-aa8f-8237bb9ff311" label="lyrics-like">no:* haec pórta Dómini, jústi in¬</l><l xml:id="m-4a5e7409-8f0e-478e-8825-75719aa6928c" facs="#m-a2b1f8fa-4d3f-47df-b639-b5e5c31ad833" label="lyrics-like">ricórdia éjus.</l><l xml:id="m-c3b5e796-5a83-49a6-85cc-2a8bbe995d61" facs="#m-204427c0-c36d-42b9-b657-b681bc510357" label="lyrics-like">trábunt in éam.</l><l xml:id="m-2feabb1a-2c37-41a9-ba8d-2388cd8fff38" facs="#m-788f423c-8213-4fc5-a515-6a3d1bc879c2" label="lyrics-like">Dícat nunc dómus Aaron :* quó¬</l><l xml:id="m-0d591a27-1352-47c4-bade-dcb23fef9fbc" facs="#m-bc80bda9-bd03-41be-bf5b-260e9ebb3ff2" label="lyrics-like">Confitébor tibi quóniam exaudi¬</l><l xml:id="m-3cb42c0d-c89b-4710-ba51-ebf202e07af6" facs="#m-7d3bfab9-ec54-40fb-851a-9083b6ecdd7e" label="lyrics-like">niam in saéculum misericórdia éjus.</l><l xml:id="m-19185b51-d5f0-4472-a096-a7a2dec28a2e" facs="#m-2dd57994-3ed1-48dd-8bae-bcf8305ec35e" label="lyrics-like">sti me:* et fáctus es mihi in sa¬</l><l xml:id="m-29bb4307-b99b-4c0a-9a0d-ff8f41d65988" facs="#m-3b4049b5-424a-4af9-b7f2-9b7e0f19a420" label="lyrics-like">Dicant nunc qui timent Dómi¬</l><l xml:id="m-5588c9c0-c991-4670-a325-1b32e835dad9" facs="#m-83ab2793-0718-4603-aeb1-8cb3d5f55fd9" label="lyrics-like">lútem.</l><l xml:id="m-89cad4d3-3eac-495a-bab4-b24c3609a1ae" facs="#m-6ad4f1ab-49d7-4fc2-890f-141704c54d42" label="lyrics-like">num :* quóniam in saéculum mi¬</l><l xml:id="m-288a9b18-546a-430d-a710-726a4091119c" facs="#m-4ba9d4cf-62b4-4ec6-9580-471317f440e1" label="lyrics-like">Lápidem quem reprobavérunt</l><l xml:id="m-49aa4ac5-d2e6-4b6c-8831-a4eeb8ade2cf" facs="#m-4cb16e16-9585-4435-a3ea-50134db93d79" label="lyrics-like">sericórdia éjus.</l><l xml:id="m-8106960d-a6a6-412f-b4ec-12eca15549b7" facs="#m-deed266d-3355-4521-8aad-ec5a832299cb" label="lyrics-like">aedificántes: “hic fáctus est in</l><l xml:id="m-bac28cc6-174d-48da-822c-71fde3e023a9" facs="#m-2f203b55-7405-45d0-8355-b1a90fdd3a37" label="lyrics-like">De tribulatióne invoeávi Dómi¬</l><l xml:id="m-d1e3b3d0-6a4e-403b-9142-9d48a0817014" facs="#m-a1cbd9c5-79ea-4469-9fed-fc259790a154" label="lyrics-like">cáput ánguli.</l><l xml:id="m-8c044a79-2b18-4a81-b26b-e94ba81db87d" facs="#m-031e2a0c-56ee-4569-873a-7be3ba8da2ae" label="lyrics-like">num :* et exaudivit me in latitú¬</l><l xml:id="m-ee8e6570-d47a-43a5-a15b-7fef395a4ae8" facs="#m-dd69df83-89e7-4b35-971c-6e389c4a494b" label="lyrics-like">À Dómino fáctum est istud :* et</l><l xml:id="m-8d903467-fcba-4adc-b56b-218a0313c244" facs="#m-771a6685-38d5-478f-b1da-5e1d11caae23" label="lyrics-like">dine Dóminus.</l><l xml:id="m-14dabba0-5452-451f-8a1c-6f584ec515e5" facs="#m-4944b014-dcd5-461d-9c0e-51bb501f7dfb" label="lyrics-like">est mirábile in óculis nóstris.</l><l xml:id="m-8fc4eb62-8299-4599-82c2-657bc5765295" facs="#m-8d02ca9b-5c0e-4575-9e15-01e0be8f4490" label="lyrics-like">Dóminus mihi adjútor: *non</l><l xml:id="m-89fd0509-d103-45a1-b9b2-e71f9385a4a0" facs="#m-30e3a430-24ba-4cae-87a8-276b54b6583a" label="lyrics-like">Haec est dies quam fécit Dómi¬</l><l xml:id="m-5772544f-d56b-4f30-8940-764a3910decd" facs="#m-55562b9b-74ce-4e6d-a394-4dd48ceac6c9" label="lyrics-like">timébo quid fáciat mihi hómo.</l><l xml:id="m-8555865a-5beb-4641-825d-227cb0ca675c" facs="#m-83159d4b-2299-43f2-9cee-0d4623d9ee80" label="lyrics-like">nus :* exsultémus et laetémur inéa.</l><l xml:id="m-7594d572-84ee-4f65-b714-e5716a437a45" facs="#m-641ced98-d8d8-47f8-b7fb-0bc9018adcac" label="lyrics-like">Dóminus mihi adjútor :* et égo</l><l xml:id="m-e10eb5fe-2bec-490a-aac8-b2e0ba12bb57" facs="#m-a63fc4cd-d392-4669-acd6-70a4e490a6cc" label="lyrics-like">ODómine sálvum me fac, f0</l><l xml:id="m-e6f26e96-881c-4aea-90dd-a67726f626eb" facs="#m-2fa12e85-c221-40fa-a858-8841bd495ff3" label="lyrics-like">despiciam inimicos méos.</l><l xml:id="m-c1c36ddc-42c7-4a41-980f-5629a70874f4" facs="#m-2522cd36-c7db-4bb9-912d-31a8a271b12c" label="lyrics-like">Dómine bene prosperâre :* bene¬</l><l xml:id="m-3520c5de-0637-4263-bbff-70c40736a242" facs="#m-2375d04e-3bdc-4a3e-b688-9a0f39973a3b" label="lyrics-like">Bónum est confidere in Dómi¬</l><l xml:id="m-9f67ef5c-17ae-4688-98f8-b8d67ba8e64c" facs="#m-2dcd262c-13fb-472e-853d-197008d99d50" label="lyrics-like">dictus qui vénit in nómine Dómini.</l><l xml:id="m-5ff7915b-9aa4-4061-97b3-36007f025a57" facs="#m-51b3e2ed-5ab2-4911-99ae-38bef538d22a" label="lyrics-like">no, * quam confidere in hómine.</l><l xml:id="m-ebc26205-6925-4cd4-a4c7-6f4460a93dca" facs="#m-ae9bf24b-623f-4a10-bc7f-eeed17cd68b8" label="lyrics-like">Benedíximus vóbis de dómo Dó¬</l><l xml:id="m-6850662b-aed6-4576-a053-3d6a9a515df3" facs="#m-4f8e5116-b78a-4eee-a500-d477ec165a75" label="lyrics-like">Bónum est speráre in Dómino,»</l><l xml:id="m-52072b78-4e4b-4bb8-88a2-addca12156dc" facs="#m-e7707d1b-9b8b-433d-9132-eed854b7c819" label="lyrics-like">mini : * Déus Dóminus, et illúxit</l><l xml:id="m-eb4e9532-5fa0-4a99-9c0c-b1b090f43fbf" facs="#m-f00f733d-58b6-45e7-a648-22237a022f95" label="lyrics-like">quam speráre in principibus.</l><l xml:id="m-0c9d5758-7514-4231-9914-bc7b884a73b4" facs="#m-361c729f-cf15-4771-bb39-8fe7139cd222" label="lyrics-like">nóbis.</l><l xml:id="m-c3361c48-7a48-42c8-ac91-f92cd7f28e0b" facs="#m-cebd1272-feb0-4e09-8bd6-760083f55599" label="lyrics-like">Omnes géntes cireuiérunt me:</l><l xml:id="m-0df2c2fe-cdfe-4d91-ac84-b32bda87bb17" facs="#m-e11165a4-2c13-4238-85cc-3c572fac35b3" label="lyrics-like">Constitúite diem solémnem in</l><l xml:id="m-e0284cf9-be5d-4999-87fe-de839dba98fb" facs="#m-368c3c2b-f3e8-4692-b3e1-528e35352fea" label="lyrics-like">et in nómine Dómini quia últus</l><l xml:id="m-04a131e4-7cd8-4956-a6c1-f75195573543" facs="#m-2f7316fa-15db-438e-85e0-6e0dc779f621" label="lyrics-like">condénsis, rusque ad córnu altáris.</l><l xml:id="m-fa4a9cc6-c71e-4e54-95cf-d43f178bde00" facs="#m-f9cff7be-99c8-42f6-82c8-7d89fa6a86bb" label="lyrics-like">súm in éos.</l><l xml:id="m-6bc10910-d40d-4556-937f-69523694a10a" facs="#m-2dd55841-c371-46c0-a53a-3099d33d69ec" label="lyrics-like">Déus méus es tu, et confitébor</l><l xml:id="m-914db9da-0c35-41d6-9ddc-76431dc54c57" facs="#m-0df2e678-f236-484c-bc74-153cb9c265a7" label="lyrics-like">Circumdántes cireumdedérunt</l><l xml:id="m-b8222589-148c-4d8b-975a-0f433817e92a" facs="#m-24656dcc-0282-4c2c-8385-b34bca1f2947" label="lyrics-like">tibi :* Déus méus es tu, et exal¬</l><l xml:id="m-b37b7ba0-e453-48fb-bfa0-4704d27b30ab" facs="#m-0737b2ad-4d8a-4be8-95fb-cddefff25ab6" label="lyrics-like">me :* et in nómine Dómini quia</l><l xml:id="m-e5b30852-e60e-4485-be28-14fdd78540b9" facs="#m-c02d6f27-8b14-4ba3-9b66-7da0383d8bc8" label="lyrics-like">tábo te.</l><l xml:id="m-9147cfc3-8e1f-4ce6-a057-3f7be9bbb555" facs="#m-656015af-36bb-44aa-861f-79696e765691" label="lyrics-like">últus súm in éos.</l><l xml:id="m-9a30791d-d057-4fab-859e-807dab74137b" facs="#m-2d59b093-7a8d-46c7-8d66-06d17a1b314e" label="lyrics-like">Confitébor tibi quóniam exaudisti</l><l xml:id="m-ac6c4f8e-88f8-48d8-8686-39d776289297" facs="#m-dec9f072-6d12-4653-86ee-ab87b508136d" label="lyrics-like">Circumdedérunt me sicut ápes,</l><l xml:id="m-2fe82aca-df6a-4c74-811f-1dda87036635" facs="#m-6da9545f-faaf-498a-8d92-8de419906ec6" label="lyrics-like">me :* et fáctus es míhi in salûtem.</l><l xml:id="m-9cf16b07-e346-403f-88e8-6fcea4d5b5a9" facs="#m-296a0c03-7b05-4112-bd08-ec75e341f2d1" label="lyrics-like">et exarsérunt sicut ignis in spinis:</l><l xml:id="m-00bfd03e-e913-461e-9058-972c43581888" facs="#m-93e2b911-c8b5-4917-9537-03bc99a367f5" label="lyrics-like">Confitémini Dómino quóniam bó¬</l><l xml:id="m-888b9c0e-332b-44c4-b2a7-819c6e44416b" facs="#m-62ed9535-687d-4376-b1c0-964efa7654ea" label="lyrics-like">et in nómine Dóminĩ quia últus súm</l><l xml:id="m-b2b6e0a3-da48-448a-ada2-79ba4a1b82f6" facs="#m-e24816ec-76f5-4ea7-a667-cfc0277084c8" label="lyrics-like">nus : * quóniam in saéculum mise¬</l><l xml:id="m-d4372f86-0035-43ff-9e96-03f1ffcab650" facs="#m-4c22e3d9-4daa-4571-be5b-2d4822253781" label="lyrics-like">in éos.</l><l xml:id="m-948368c7-ed3c-45a8-839f-24bc73ae2dcf" facs="#m-2c2b4738-44fe-4959-afcd-8cf52d4f96ee" label="lyrics-like">ricórdia éjus.</l><l xml:id="m-3e51c04e-074b-42a3-92c3-e9d685bf2f21" facs="#m-dd82e52b-d648-4f2e-83f2-c68baf449da8" label="lyrics-like">Impúlsus evérsus súm ut cáde¬</l><l xml:id="m-71bcf3fb-1453-46a4-9686-bbda07dc612a" facs="#m-7c0e9899-6de9-41de-99a6-bca12c6b9c61" label="lyrics-like">Glória Pátri, et Filio, * et Spiri¬</l><l xml:id="m-83440d7e-e5b0-43ee-9e1d-a1cbdabc5537" facs="#m-449f92cb-5b26-4cc5-8ea3-c170ae28c08a" label="lyrics-like">rem:* et Dóminus suscépit me.</l><l xml:id="m-f443459c-14e1-415a-a222-950566c112e5" facs="#m-e11ade50-7aa4-4f83-aae3-164b0464c590" label="lyrics-like">tui sáncto.</l><l xml:id="m-0a6cf2b4-1f33-4991-8911-58183fbbde78" facs="#m-33be5674-b342-4f3e-9cce-ce0f4f6c04f5" label="lyrics-like">Fortitúdo méa et laus mea Dómi¬</l><l xml:id="m-5b5de717-2e8f-4b69-ac27-bd095f28ea68" facs="#m-7141f9b9-fbb2-4147-9e3a-576484454e8e" label="lyrics-like">Sicut érat in principio, et núne,</l><l xml:id="m-c1a92b2b-5aae-4432-b7cf-1d34df85c5d5" facs="#m-86b7e545-66cf-4154-806b-dc4b339e7efa" label="lyrics-like">nus:* et fáctus est mihi in salútem.</l><l xml:id="m-e165ba25-f766-4b72-b1b9-614336ea684e" facs="#m-d1395c0d-4090-4e91-bd6e-76fb6eea3dc9" label="lyrics-like">et semper, * et in saécula saeculó¬</l><l xml:id="m-8ea6f53d-2bb3-4b10-8b0a-e412b2c964ff" facs="#m-ebf1fdd0-185d-497b-8dad-c896669eb64e" label="lyrics-like">Vox exsultatiónis et salútis * in</l><l xml:id="m-6a0d5fe1-bdb8-41bb-b77d-321db73951d8" facs="#m-705524ce-3823-4ae7-a730-d390abc4714b" label="ambiguous">rum. Amen.</l><l xml:id="m-50ddb0d5-6c02-4692-93db-ebd524752bc2" facs="#m-4715afc4-5a84-4ded-a763-286d9f004e39" label="lyrics-like">tabernáculis justórum.</l><l xml:id="m-d6c68e23-3e28-4a84-8eda-12e60152fe7f" facs="#m-30ccc207-e380-41dd-a817-fb04a1fee2cf" label="lyrics-like">Déxtera Dómini fécit virtútem:</l><l xml:id="m-ae2181b9-9db4-447b-a85c-648b614e3511" facs="#m-ddb8147e-d4bf-4fe2-a8ab-c5ab4d126413" label="lyrics-like">The Glória Pátri. is said at the end</l><l xml:id="m-7e8976d1-95fa-432b-8c1f-8ee48097afab" facs="#m-e8fcaab0-bbf8-4468-ba8d-fed6ce45e8a9" label="lyrics-like">déxtera Dómini exaltávit me,</l><l xml:id="m-a97f8f5d-94a9-4e60-a2c3-f7c047f799da" facs="#m-40502ba4-7da7-462a-969d-504d1dd01b29" label="text-like">of alt the Psalms, untess the contrary</l><l xml:id="m-ff14bb5b-0715-4c22-a242-135b8ee8cce7" facs="#m-6b5d1108-e474-4b42-b5f4-44b4be3fa893" label="lyrics-like">déxtera Dómini fécit virtutem.</l><l xml:id="m-2593ef93-7293-4355-bea4-c868116b32d8" facs="#m-6c52a915-3e44-4974-a4ff-f4b74c64b491" label="ambiguous">be indicated.</l><l xml:id="m-e44acb24-b3ae-44c5-99ce-dedf4a3a6a5f" facs="#m-2a4047d8-de0b-42af-a4a6-c1dc81ed3cad" label="lyrics-like">Ps.118. Beáti immaculáti. p. 226. (This Psalm is intoned by the Cantor.)</l></lg></div></section></score></mdiv></body></music>
</mei>